   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_03",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Not bad at all, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.99,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is it a bad idea to bike in the winter?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.42,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "cycling.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Not at all, lots of people do. You just need good lights, warm gloves and a bit more caution on ice.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.9,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cycling.dlg3",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What about my hands? They freeze even in fall.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 2.73,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "cycling.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Try lobster style gloves, they keep fingers together for warmth but still let you brake easily.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.84,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cycling.dlg3",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hmm, actually maybe I'll just",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.71,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "cycling.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "take the bus when it snows.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.19,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "cycling.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's a sensible compromise. Ride on dry days and skip the icy ones.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 1.0,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cycling.dlg3",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
